   //  5. The stack in SDRAM does not use memory in byte range 0xA0000000
   //     through to 0xBFFFFFFF as these addresses cannot be converted to
   //     word-addresses.

   // ----------------------- 128MB DMC0(DDR-A) ---------------------------------
   // 128MB DMC0 DDR3 SDRAM memory is partitioned and used as follows:
